# CLAUDE.md is a local, one-line pointer to private Claude Code notes. Keep it out of this public repo.
# New device setup:
#   1. git clone https://github.com/JRHacka/claude-notes.git ~/claude-notes
#   2. In this project folder, create CLAUDE.md containing the single line:
#        @~/claude-notes/DnD-Dice-Roller.md
CLAUDE.md

# Full-size original art (masters for editing). The web-size WebP versions in assets/ are what the page uses.
art-source/

# In assets/, only the web-size .webp files are committed. Original exports (PNG, JPEG, ...) dropped in here
# stay local, so the big files never enter the history.
assets/**
!assets/**/
!assets/**/*.webp
